      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# noise is bad.\n\nA Grafana panel for the office television that answers one question from across the room: **how bad are things\nright now?** Nothing healthy is ever drawn, so the screen gets noisier only as more things break. Everything below is\nthe same panel, live, each showing off one thing it does. This is real Grafana and nothing you do here is saved: open\na panel's menu (**⋮**) → **Inspect** to see its query and every setting.\n\nFull size: [Watch it break](d/a538aeff-5a8a-42a5-901c-938d896fdd6f) · [No issues](d/noise-is-bad-quiet) · [Real data](d/noise-is-bad-prometheus) · [Sloth](d/noise-is-bad-sloth) ·\n[Transitions](d/noise-is-bad-transitions) · **[Put it on a television →](tv)**\n",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
